{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2018b.q27.material.recovered", "text": "材料： 1933年5月，美国国会通过《农业调整法》，一方面控制农产品产量，从而提高农产品价格；另一方面，政府对缩减耕地、缩减产量的农民提供补贴。不久，国会又通过《农业调整法》的修正案，允许政府采用减少美元含金量等办法，增加全国货币流通量和信用贷款数量。1933年6月，美国国会通过《国家工业复兴法》，提高工人工资和工业品价格。在《国家工业复兴法》的影响下，物价很快上涨。价格上升吸收了投放到市场的货币，增加了货币存量。货币存量的增加，导致名义收入的增加和就业人口的增加。这一增加，又进一步提高了物价。 ——李世安《美国金融改革及其影响》", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "229e305b53186d565abc9b8fa4758b21f1fe27278abe83b843d426028d906ef9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2511, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2779, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "229e305b53186d565abc9b8fa4758b21f1fe27278abe83b843d426028d906ef9"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2018b.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k10"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.310.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2018b.q27"], "word_count": 268, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "229e305b53186d565abc9b8fa4758b21f1fe27278abe83b843d426028d906ef9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2511, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2779, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": 